	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quamvis pauca habeam, quae ad te nunc scribam, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>colendissime domine compater, tamen, quia hic se mihi obtulit <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nuncius, per quem tu, si quid habueris, rescribere <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>potes, nolui eum omnino vacuum ad te dimittere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Nostrae res habent ut prius.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ferebatur iuniorem <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaud<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>i<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ę</placeName> ducem esse submersum, sed nemo venit, qui <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>hunc rumorem confirmare velit, ideoque veremur, ne non <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sit verum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> quoque fertur marchionem <persName ref="p18422">Albertum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>denuo caesum ab <persName ref="p18509">Augusto</persName>, <persName ref="p18250">Mauritii ducis</persName> fratre; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sed quam sit hoc verum adhuc dubito.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nihil certi habemus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> retulit mihi d. d. <persName ref="p20206">Mat<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>thaeus Gribaldus</persName>, iurisconsultus <placeName ref="l377">Pataviensis</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>principem illum, qui filio suo regnum affectabat, de quo <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tu quoque proxime ad me scribebas, capite truncatum esse et hoc <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>certo constare, alteram vero <persName ref="p8375">Heinrychi VIII</persName>. regis <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>filiam, <persName ref="p18538">Caesaris</persName> neptem, declaratam esse reginam piosque omnes in <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>magno versari discrimine, quod illa papisticis addicta <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>suspitionibus veterem idololatriam reductura videatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Quod sane summopere deplorandum; sed quoniam negoti<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>um ipsum non humanum est, sed ipsius domini, illum effecturum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>spero, ut mundus agnoscat non in unius hominis vita et <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>persona vim regni sui consistere, et spero tanto gloriosius <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>veritatem emersuram, quanto gravioribus calamitatum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>procellis nunc mergi videtur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Refert idem <placeName ref="l2801">Corsicam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><placeName ref="l1121">Genuensium</placeName> insulam ditissimam et tres munitissimas <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>urbes habentem, a <placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName> occupatam et <placeName ref="l1121">Genuenses</placeName> in magno <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>versari periculo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Inter exercitus <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontanos</placeName> induciae <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>sunt constitutę; putant multi praeludia esse futurę <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>pacis inter <persName ref="p18538">Caesarem</persName> et <persName ref="p8112">Gallum</persName>, pro qua valde cardinales <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>quidam laborant, qui cuperent hos monarchas unitos, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ut Christi veritatem tanto facilius supprimere possent.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>De nostris ex <placeName ref="l2589">Picardia</placeName> nihil habemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName> se<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ditio gliscit adhuc.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Exuberatus est plane illius urbis st<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>atus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Potentiores tantum non coniurant in <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Is summis se opponit viribus, et mori paratus est pro <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>retinendis ecclesię suę institutis, et quantum intelligo, contro<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>versię huius universę primaria causa est rigor ille disci<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>plinę ecclesiasticae illic institutę, qua omnes tantum non ministrorum <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>subiiciuntur pedibus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Id quod potentioribus est grave <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>et intolerabile, et hinc nostri quoque <persName ref="p540">Calvino</persName> parum <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>sunt propitii, quia putant eum plus nimium sibi <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>arrogare.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ut audio secessit nunc ex urbe ad <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>quendam nobilem, non procul ab urbe.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Non tamen abdicavit se <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>ministerio.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1049">Farellus</persName> illic proficiscitur pro lite componenda, <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>quam utinam non sua vehementia incendat magis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Nostri <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> putant, nullam fore ecclesię formam, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>nisi eadem disciplina introducatur, sicuti facile videbis ex <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>eo scripto, quod ad te proxime misi.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Sed intolerabilior hęc <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>disciplina nostris foret multo, quam <placeName ref="l167">Genevensibus</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">De <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Serveto ferunt, eos scripturos ad <placeName ref="l862">Helveticas</placeName> ecclesias, et iam <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>hac transiit quęstor <placeName ref="l167">Genevensis</placeName>, quem dicebant pro hac ca[usa] <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> petere.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Nos tamen super ea re non convenit.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Fac ergo s[ci<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>am] an apud vos fuerit.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Deinde scribe, quid tibi videatur [de] <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>illo <placeName ref="l280">Lausan[n]ensium</placeName> scripto, quod ad te misi, quidque hic sequi <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>debeamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> te cum tuis omnibus salutat.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Idem <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>mea quoque facit uxor, quę, ut puto, propediem ad vos <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>descendet propter negotia quędam privata.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Hodie incidi venam <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>et habemus examen, ut plura non possim.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Boni ergo consule haec.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Quid <lb xml:id="p2z13"/><placeName ref="l21">Badenę</placeName> actum sit nondum certe cognovi.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salut[a] d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName>, generos quoque tuos om<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>nes ex [me].</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 18. septemb. 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">Ioannes Hallerus</persName> tuus ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo praestantissimoque viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>domino et compatri suo pie colendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de">M. <persName ref="p495">Heinr<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ych Bullingeren</persName> zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>